      "body": "Euro Pratik Sales Limited (NSEI: EUROPRATIK) agreed to acquire 51% stakes in Chawla Brothers Private Limited for INR 29.1 million on March 23, 2026. A cash consideration of INR 29.1 million will be paid by Euro Pratik Sales Limited. As part of consideration, INR 29.1 million is paid towards common equity of Chawla Brothers Private Limited. The acquisition valued at INR 33.2 million including capital infusion of INR 4.1 million.\n\nFor the period ending March 31, 2025, Chawla Brothers Private Limited reported total revenue of INR 49.5 million. \n\nThe expected completion of the transaction is March 31, 2026.",
